Merge relay management, builtin server candidates, idle latency preview, and local IP support into patch 9 while retaining the PING fix.

Remove 中国·江苏(2) yordon.cn:11451 from the shipped relay.cfg and restore-default table. Keep it only in the optional built-in add-server catalog; the remaining factory list has 12 entries.

Ported-from: https://github.com/aylz10/ldn_mitm2/tree/beta/bsd-broadcast-relay-TONYX9000
